<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 296 0 R
/T (Anthropic's severity assessments are produced before any maintainer input. Project maintainers often apply project-specific severity rules that Claude does not have access to at run time, so what one maintainer rates as critical another may rate as low. The external security research firms incorporate that context, which is why their assessments tend to be lower.)
/E (Anthropic's severity assessments are produced before any maintainer input. Project maintainers often apply project-specific severity rules that Claude does not have access to at run time, so what one maintainer rates as critical another may rate as low. The external security research firms incorporate that context, which is why their assessments tend to be lower.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
